  "content": "\n\n<h2>关于</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/beautify-refabricated?color=00AF5C&label=downloads&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_809311_downloads.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/809311.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft Versions\"></a></p>\n<h6>这是 <strong>非官方 Fabric</strong> 版本的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-decorate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beautify</a>，&nbsp;采用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/Beautify/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a> 许可证授权，请支持原版作品！</h6>\n<h2>模组内容</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/82240d271f55e1b30163f5c889c8d4f95414748cf105a2fc59511d868f8dca48/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f744453426968552e6a70672e706e67\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/cfe784fb6b44808f1e82645adcb35ff730f3565c4a536ff65520b869e15ac803/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f61566e3442366d2e676966\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>什么是 Beautify？</strong></span></p>\n<p>Beautify 是一款客户端与服务器端兼容的<strong>装饰模组(deco-mod)</strong>，提供了大量<strong>原版风格</strong>的自定义模型，为你的建筑增色添彩。</p>\n<p>本模组的宗旨是在不牺牲想象力与创造力的前提下，增加建筑的细节。<br>\n此外，大多数方块都包含新功能。例如，盆栽植物（如单格高的花朵）可以使用骨粉进行复制。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>版本 [Fabric]：</strong></span> 1.18.2 |&nbsp;1.19.2 | 1.20.x</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>更多图片：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7wHu3qe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LGUotre.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M7AfS0o.png?1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"446\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/63BR9j4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\">更多示例图片</span></a></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#9cf\">&nbsp;<strong>Jeikir 展示视频：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5uXGHUit038?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p></div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>功能摘要：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">悬挂花盆</span>&nbsp;支持自定义花朵模型及多种植物</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">书堆</span>&nbsp;提供不同模型，可为附魔台充能</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">百叶窗</span>&nbsp;为窗户增添细节或打造新型入口</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">相框</span>&nbsp;包含所有原版 16x16 画作主题及更多内容</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">绳索</span>&nbsp;悬挂花盆与其他方块可依附于此，玩家也可攀爬</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新型光源</span>：竹灯笼、烛台/吊灯、光蕴罐、灯泡</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">格栅</span>&nbsp;用于在墙壁和天花板上摆放植物</li>\n<li><em>更多内容即将推出</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>有关方块及其用法的更多信息，请访问<span style=\"color:#9cf\"><a style=\"color:#9cf\" href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/Beautify/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基百科！</a></span></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鸣谢：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:400\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/CapoFantasma97\" rel=\"nofollow\">CapoFantasma97</a></strong>&nbsp;(意大利语翻译)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:400\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/ocarinayoy\" rel=\"nofollow\">ocarinayoy</a>&nbsp;</strong>(西班牙语翻译)</span></p>",
